From: Henry Wang <Henry.Wang@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 21 Sep 2023 14:03:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] platform/rss/kronos: Import NCI-Tower driver from
 RD-Fremont-928

Port NCI-Tower driver from RD-Infra-928 release.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Henry Wang <Henry.Wang@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Wei Chen <wei.chen@arm.com>
